{"4464260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arrow Flow", "steam_appid": 4464260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level, the arrows can only move in their own direction, and your task is to correctly organize their path to the exit. It sounds simple, but with each new stage the scheme becomes more complex, routes intersect, and the space for maneuver is reduced. One mistake and the arrows will collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you figure out the perfect sequence of actions and release them all? Test your attentiveness, patience and ability to see a solution where at first glance there is none.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level, the arrows can only move in their own direction, and your task is to correctly organize their path to the exit. It sounds simple, but with each new stage the scheme becomes more complex, routes intersect, and the space for maneuver is reduced. One mistake and the arrows will collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you figure out the perfect sequence of actions and release them all? Test your attentiveness, patience and ability to see a solution where at first glance there is none.</p>", "short_description": "Welcome to Arrow Flow - a stylish, minimalist puzzle game where every decision requires care and thoughtful strategy. Use logic and spatial thinking to direct all the arrows to the exit and prevent them from crossing.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464260/d7ff082a8098f0985e7543e7502cd599342f37e4/header.jpg?t=1787726625", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464260/a0f473cd1f06158c190d8b6f1826ba506b79544f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787726625", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446